  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-20 (export-list question): option C3. A package.json exports map keeps that package's own JS/TS exports from the library-export demotion when a production server entry exists. Measured on the 23 PR 4 repos: vite keeps its 61 exports once the alias form is detected; ripgrep and web-app rulings hold; elsewhere only 4 gemini-cli devtools exports change, entry list unchanged. C3 is built in PR 6; the aliased createServer import (part 1) follows in a later PR. Options table: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr6/nihov/RESULTS.md."  # b6b3
