  message: "Export-list question answered and built: option C3 shipped in PR #2309 (dev eaa18ee23). A JS/TS export whose nearest package.json declares a non-empty exports is not demoted; detect_entrypoints takes repo_root. 23 repos: 22 identical, gemini-cli 4 devtools exports undemoted; vite with the alias simulated keeps 61 exports. Item stays open for parts 1-4 (aliased createServer import, receiver import-based match, require form, Apollo names). Evidence: pr6/nihov/BUILD.md. Residual: WI-lozib."  # 5329
